# ============================================================
# 取证知识库 .gitignore
# 原则：文本（md/json/ocr/脚本）普通入库；图片由 Git LFS 管理（见 .gitattributes）
# ============================================================

# --- 系统/编辑器杂项 ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.swp
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/cache

# --- Python 缓存 ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- 本地临时产物（不入库）---
.pip-tmp/
.pylibs/
.conv/
*.recovered.md

# --- 可再生瞬时文件（脚本每次运行重新生成）---
_reports/integrity-report.txt
ocr/_pending.txt
